[34.560686, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J\u001b[1;33m━━ Step 3/4: the new unit tests (tests/test_hdf5.py of the PR head) on PR #2, then on the PR head\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m \u001b[32mOPTS='-q -o log_cli=false -o asyncio_default_fixture_loop_scope=function --tb=no -rN --disable-warnings'\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m \u001b[32mK='registered_slice_composes or reads_only_requested_elements'\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m \u001b[32m(cd wt-pr2 && .venv/bin/pytest $OPTS tests/test_hdf5.py -k \"$K\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
